tilization.</p><p><br></p><p>Powered by Intel Xeon E5-2600 series processors, the DL360p Gen8 provides scalable performance for virtualization, databases, web applications, file services, and other business workloads.</p><p><br></p><p>The server supports DDR3 HP SmartMemory and flexible SFF storage configurations. SAS and SATA drive options, HP Smart Array RAID controllers, PCIe expansion, and flexible networking allow the system to be configured for different business and data center requirements.</p><p><br></p><p>With HP iLO 4 remote management and redundant power supply options, the DL360p Gen8 provides convenient server administration and reliable operation in enterprise environments.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>HP ProLiant DL360p Gen8 1U Rack Server</li><li>Dual-socket Intel Xeon E5-2600 processor support</li><li>DDR3 HP SmartMemory support</li><li>Compact 1U rack-mount design</li><li>Flexible SFF storage configurations</li><li>SAS and SATA drive support</li><li>HP Smart Array RAID controller options</li><li>HP iLO 4 remote server management</li><li>PCIe expansion capability</li><li>Multiple Ethernet networking options</li><li>Redundant power supply support</li><li>Efficient rack-space utilization</li><li>Enterprise-grade server architecture</li><li>Suitable for virtualization and business applications</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"HPE ProLiant DL380 Gen10 Server","href":"/hpe-proliant-dl380-gen10-server","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"},{"name":"HP ProLiant DL180 Gen9 Server","href":"/hp-proliant-dl180-gen9-server","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"},{"name":"HP ProLiant DL380 Gen9","href":"/hp-proliant-dl380-gen9","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"},{"name":"HP ProLiant DL380P Gen8 Server","href":"/hp-proliant-dl380p-gen8-server","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"},{"name":"HPE ProLiant DL360 Gen10 Server","hr